DESCRIPTION:Warriors from across Teyvat continue to exchange techniques an
 d refine their tactics together. Recently\, skilled shooters from the Knig
 hts of Favonius\, Fontaine's Maison Gardiennage\, and Natlan's Flower-Feat
 her Clan assembled at Lumidouce Harbor for a distinctive joint exercise...
 \n\n
